@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:登记采购验收与</u>\n<u>退换控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:采购</u>" as Purchase
participant "<u>:采购项目</u>" as PurchaseItem
participant "<u>:验收</u>" as Receipt
participant "<u>:验收项目</u>" as ReceiptItem
participant "<u>:批次存量</u>" as Stock
participant "<u>:库存变动</u>" as Movement
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-28办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-28办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Purchase : 核对到货依据(本次随货依据、原约定)
activate Purchase
Purchase -> PurchaseItem : 核对交付及差异(累计到货与本次量)
activate PurchaseItem
PurchaseItem --> Purchase : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PurchaseItem
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
K -> Receipt : 登记本次验收(到货、合格、拒收、待检)
activate Receipt
Receipt -> ReceiptItem : 核对数量组成(材料、批次及位置)
activate ReceiptItem
ReceiptItem --> Receipt : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate ReceiptItem
Receipt --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Receipt
K -> Stock : 接收合格入库(已确认验收项目)
activate Stock
Stock -> Movement : 保留验收入库(原验收来源及合格量)
activate Movement
Movement --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Movement
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
K -> Purchase : 更新履行进度(本次验收及差异)
activate Purchase
Purchase --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Purchase
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Movement
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
